again.\"\nindex\t\"Failed to generate interface\"\nindex\t\"Failed to delete interface\"\nindex\t\"You have several tasks in progress. Please wait until they finish before submitting more.\"\nindex\t\"Video task detection failed.\"\nindex\t\"This field is required\"\nindex\t\"Invalid format\"\nindex\t\"Too short\"\nindex\t\"Too long\"\nindex\t\"Invalid email format\"\nindex\t\"Invalid phone format\"\nindex\t\"Password mismatch\"\nindex\t\"File too large\"\nindex\t\"File type not supported\"\nindex\t\"Tencent HY 3D Global\"\nindex\t\"Tencent H<span class=\\\\\"\nindex\t\"Tencent, HY, 3D, Open Source, Large Model, HY Model, AI Creation, 3D Generation, Texture Generation, Animation Generation\"\nindex\t\"Explore more fun 3D applications here\"\nindex\t\"Offers diverse 3D generation capabilities,more fun applications are being continuously added,stay tuned\"\nindex\t\"Topology Selection\"\nindex\t\"The three and four sides are combined, suitable for simple structures\"\nindex\t\"Maximize model details, suitable for game engines\"\nindex\t\"Provides better smoothness and regular structure, suitable for model editing\"\nindex\t\"Adaptively generate models with hundreds to thousands of faces based on object complexity. Triangles or quadrilaterals can be selected. Topology wiring conforms to art standards. Simple objects are recommended; low-poly generation is not supported for complex objects. Generation time is expected to be long, please be patient\"\nindex\t\"Upload model requirements\"\nindex\t\"After uploading the model topology, a untextured model will be generated. Please upload the untextured model\"\nindex\t\"Upload a simple model as possible. Too complex models cannot be topologically modified\"\nindex\t\"Input text, images, or a untextured model to generate a low-poly model with neat wiring\"\nindex\t\"View the following works\"\nindex\t\"Add Sketch\"\nindex\t\"Solid color background\"\nindex\t\"No text\"\nindex\t\"Clean lines\"\nindex\t\"Enter text description\"\nindex\t\"Please describe the 3D model you want to generate in combination with the sketch. Prompt requirements: 1. It is recommended to describe the category + color, etc., of the object; 2. Try to describe content consistent with the image.\"\nindex\t\"Upload sketch, enter commands, and generate 3D model with one click\"\nindex\t\"Try the following inspirations\"\nindex\t\"WebGL is not enabled or not supported. Please refer to the tutorials below to activate or upgrade to the latest version of Chrome, Firefox, or Edge browser\"\nindex\t\"Your browser only supports WebGL 1.0 ({{version}}). It is recommended to upgrade to the latest version of Chrome, Firefox, or Edge browser\"\nindex\t\"Your browser has WebGL 2.0 ({{version}}) enabled\"\nindex\t\"WebGL Detection/Activation\"\nindex\t\"If a green message appears on the current page, it means <Text>WebGL2.0</Text> is activated and you can view models normally. However, if a red or yellow warning message is displayed, it indicates that your <Text>WebGL</Text> may have issues. Please try one of the following tutorials to resolve this issue.\"\nindex\t\"Chrome (Android/PC) Enable WebGL2 Tutorial\"\nindex\t\"In some Chrome versions, WebGL may not be activated by default. Activating it allows you to view models. To verify if WebGL can be activated, please follow the steps below (Google Chrome tutorial):\"\nindex\t\"Click the following link:\"\nindex\t\"Search <Text>WebGL</Text> and enable it\"\nindex\t\"Reload the browser\"\nindex\t\"Return to the current page and refresh to check if it now supports \"\nindex\t\"iPhone/iPad Activate WebGL2 Tutorial\"\nindex\t\"This tutorial is only applicable when you use IOS 15.0 or higher. Devices using IOS 14.x or lower may not be able to use WebGL even if it is activated. Please note that only Safari needs to activate WebGL, and other browsers default to using it\"\nindex\t\"First, go to the phone <Text>Settings</Text>, search for <Text>Safari</Text> and select it\"\nindex\t\"Scroll down to <Text>Advanced</Text>, click to enter\"\nindex\t\"Select the last option <Text>Experimental Features</Text>, click to enter\"\nindex\t\"Find <Text>WebGL 2.0</Text>, and turn on the switch\"\nindex\t\"Mac Safari Activate WebGL2 Tutorial\"\nindex\t\"This tutorial is only applicable when you use Safari 15.0 or higher. Devices using Safari 14.x or lower may not be able to view models even if WebGL is activated. Please note that only Safari needs to activate WebGL, and other browsers default to using it\"\nindex\t\"First, you must open <Text>Safari &gt; Preferences</Text>.\"\nindex\t\"Select the <Text>Advanced</Text> tab, at the bottom of the current tab bar, check <Text>Show Developer Menu in the Menu Bar</Text>\"\nindex\t\"Find <Text>Developer Menu</Text> in the top bar of the Safari browser, open it and go to <Text>Experimental Features</Text>, and check <Text>WebGL 2.0</Text>\"\nindex\t\"Still cannot solve the problem?\"\nindex\t\"If the above tutorials still cannot solve the problem, please try to upgrade to the latest version of Chrome, Firefox, or Edge browser.\"\nindex\t\"The Share Content Has Expired\"\nindex\t\"Welcome to\"\nindex\t\"Access your 3D creation journey\"\nindex\t\"Apply for experience\"\nindex\t\"Application successful, please wait patiently\"\nindex\t\"Application failed, please try again later\"\nindex\t\"View more 3D models\"\nindex\t\"Input text, images, or a white model to generate a low-poly model with neat wiring\"\nindex\t\"The video is not playable.\"\nindex\t\"Original UV\"\nindex\t\"Design philosophy\"\nindex\t\"Texture style\"\nindex\t\"Create models\"\nindex\t\"More information\"\nindex\t\"Generated information\"\nindex\t\"Currently, the download link is being retrieved. Switching models or leaving this page will cancel the download.\"\nindex\t\"Currently, the download of files in the {{fileFormat}} format is not supported.\"\nindex\t\"The mobile version only supports model viewing. For more functions, please visit us on the c